# Prompt Security Standards

Before generating or modifying any prompt:

1. Run: `npx @promptsonar/cli scan {{file}} --json`
2. Block on CRITICAL findings.
3. Enforce the 7-Factor Standard: https://github.com/meghal86/promptsonar#7-factor-standard
4. Never hardcode secrets or pass raw user input to system instructions.
